{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionModel\/selectedItemIndex","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"selectedItemIndex"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SCSelectionModel(py)selectedItemIndex","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"STV"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"selectedItemIndex"}],"role":"symbol","title":"selectedItemIndex","symbolKind":"property"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"copy","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSNumber","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSNumber"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"selectedItemIndex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you have bound this section to an object or a key, you can define the section’s selection","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"using either the bound property value or the key value, respectively.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Note"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In case of no selection, this property will be set to an NSNumber of value -1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This property reflects the current section’s selection. You can set this property"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to define the section’s selection."}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionmodel\/selecteditemindex"]}],"schem